@sheet Data [csv:noheader]
2026-01-01,100,2
2026-01-02,150,1
2026-01-03,90,3

@sheet Summary
-Label-Value-
| First amount | =Data!B1 |
| First two amount | =Data!B1+Data!B2 |
| Total qty | =Data!C1+Data!C2+Data!C3 |

@sheet Board
-Label-Value-
| Carry | =Summary!B2+Summary!B3 |
| Qty copy | =Summary!B4 |
